msgstr "використання: rubrapack build <src.toml> -o <out.msi|out.msm|out.msix|out.msixbundle|out.msixupload> [-D NAME=VALUE] [--arch x64|arm64|x86 (список для набору)] [--compress none] [--jobs N] [--nfc] [--reproducible] [--key <key> [--cert <chain.pem>] [--pass-env VAR | --pass-file FILE] [--timestamp <URL> [--tsa-trust <certificates>] [--tls-trust <certificates>] [--system-roots] [--proxy <URL>]] [--allow-unsigned-cabs]] [--unsigned-test] [--msix-compress deflate|store] [--flat] [--winget DIR]"

